        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A rhythm-action casual game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1: This game has 500 types of playing method.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2: It supports up to 5 types of playing method simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3: Objects with the same border belong to the same type of playing method.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4: Each playing method loop only requires pressing 1 to 2 keyboard keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5: Objects from different types of playing method exist simultaneously but do not affect each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below are demonstrations of playing three levels individually and playing them together:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165440/extras/9cbb5557e4d27ce17aabff3c790607a3.poster.avif?t=1769057466\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165440/extras/9cbb5557e4d27ce17aabff3c790607a3.webm?t=1769057466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165440/extras/9cbb5557e4d27ce17aabff3c790607a3.mp4?t=1769057466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165440/extras/ff2e867eaff5699bfe6398d4438bcd88.poster.avif?t=1769057466\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165440